.MARINE...as of 11:41 AM PDT Wednesday...A moderate NW breeze and
moderate seas will continue through Thursday. By Friday, a
tighter pressure gradient will cause a steady increase in wind
speed through the weekend, with a strong NW breeze expected
Saturday and Sunday. A moderate SW swell from distant tropical
cyclones will continue through the week.

